== 6. Theorem 13.1(a0), (a1), (a2) ==
  50000 random pairs (a on Y with bottom, p on Y): max(TV - dis) = 1.11e-16, max(dis - TV - noise) = 1.11e-16, max(noise/2 - dis) = -2.40e-08 (all <= 0)
  (a2) exact binomial: largest Pr[rho above the bound]/delta over m in 10..1000, 4 deltas, rho grid = 0.1370 (<= 1)
  (a1) largest Pr[no disagreement]/delta when rho > ln(1/delta)/m: 0.997348 (< 1)
  'about 4.4 ln(1/delta)/m' when rho_hat = ln(1/delta)/m: 1 + sqrt(2) + 2 = 4.4142

